93
00:08:16,597 --> 00:08:19,033
¿Por qué quieres ayudarme?

94
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:20,434
Ni siquiera me conoces.

95
00:08:23,971 --> 00:08:25,373
Cuando conocí a tu hermana...

96
00:08:27,274 --> 00:08:29,276
yo estaba...

97
00:08:29,877 --> 00:08:31,445
asustado de...

98
00:08:32,646 --> 00:08:33,981
